# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# bakeoff — credential NAMES only. Never commit a value.
#
# Copy to .env and fill the values in your editor, or use a helper that writes
# them without echoing them. Do not paste a key into a chat transcript: the
# transcript is persisted and a pasted key must then be rotated.
#
# .env is gitignored. The harness reads these variables from the process
# environment at run time only. It never reads, returns, prints or persists a
# value: env.ts checks presence and shape and returns a boolean plus a problem
# code. redact.ts scrubs any value that reaches a log, result or report anyway.
#
# LEAVE THE VALUES EMPTY IN THIS FILE.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Model provider credentials --------------------------------------------
# Required by config A, B, D, E (orchestrator + spec + judge seats) and by
# config A/C (Claude Sonnet 5 subagent seat).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Required by config C (Kimi K3 orchestrator) and config D (Kimi K3 subagent).
MOONSHOT_API_KEY=

# Required by config B (DeepSeek V4 Pro subagent).
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Required by config E (GPT-5.6 Luna subagent).
# Config E is additionally blocked on pricing: no primary-sourced per-MTok
# price for GPT-5.6 Luna exists in the research packet. See PRICE_TABLE in
# src/contracts.ts. `npm run bakeoff -- preflight` prints the exact remediation.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Optional non-secret endpoint overrides --------------------------------
# Consumed by the provider adapter layer, NOT by this scaffold. Setting any of
# these routes traffic through a gateway/proxy. Preflight WARNS when one is set:
# two documented community cost blowups were gateway integration bugs that
# silently broke prompt caching (doc 04 section 7), and doc 03 section 6.4 records
# that Anthropic does not support routing Claude Code to non-Claude models
# through any gateway. A broken cache is a 0%-hit-rate run priced at up to
# 2.4x the modelled bill, and it is invisible in every log except the cache
# usage fields.
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=
# MOONSHOT_BASE_URL=
# DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=
